modularmachinery.lightningcraft_infusion_multiblock.modifier.rf_generator.desc=Replace the §eAdvanced Lightning Cell§r with an §eRF Lightning Generator§r to multiply the processing speed by 5.
modularmachinery.mob_loot_fabricator.modifier.celestial_crystal.desc=Note: The §eCelestial Collector Crystal§r must be attuned to §eLucerna§r for the multiblock to form.

